---
const areas = [
  ['Electronics & PCB Design','Built the dedicated flight computer from the ground up, including electronic architecture, PCB design, and sensor integration.'],
  ['Actuation & Control','Developed the software interface between the flight controller and the physical airbrake mechanism.'],
  ['Feedback Control','Developed flight-state estimation, apogee prediction, and predictive feedback control in simulation.'],
  ['Embedded Communication','Worked on sensor communication, byte-level data handling, and efficient real-time computation.'],
  ['Flight & Controller Simulation','Developed flight dynamics and controller simulations using MATLAB and Simulink to evaluate system behavior.'],
];
---
<section id="my-contribution" aria-labelledby="contribution-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">MY CONTRIBUTION</p>
  <h2 id="contribution-heading">building the intelligence behind the rocket.</h2>
  <p class="intro">I led the development of the airbrake flight computer, electronics, and embedded control software — connecting sensor data, flight prediction, and mechanical actuation into an integrated system.</p>
  <ol>{areas.map(([title, detail], index) => <li><span aria-hidden="true">0{index+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{detail}</p></li>)}</ol>
</section>
<style>
  section {border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-block:var(--section-space)}
  h2 {font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,4rem);max-width:23ch}
  .intro {max-width:74ch;margin:18px 0 32px}
  ol {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;list-style:none;padding:0}
  li {display:grid;grid-template-rows:subgrid;grid-row:span 3;gap:8px;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,34px);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--blue)}
  li:nth-child(2){background:var(--sage)}li:nth-child(3){background:var(--lavender)}li:nth-child(4){background:var(--cream)}
  li:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}
  li span {font-size:.8rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted)}
  li h3 {font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.6rem)}
  li p {max-width:74ch}
  @media(max-width:660px){ol {grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
